@startuml Cancel-Approved-Request-AlternateFlow
title Cancel Approved Request - Alternate Flow

actor Employee as emp
participant "Intranet Portal" as portal
participant "VTS Application" as vts
participant "VTS Database" as db
participant "Email Service" as email
participant "Manager" as mgr

emp -> portal: Click VTS link from intranet
portal -> vts: Redirect with employee credentials
vts -> vts: Verify authentication

vts -> db: Query employee vacation requests\n(last 6 months + future 18 months)
db -> vts: Return all vacation requests & statuses
vts -> emp: Display vacation request summary\nand current statuses

emp -> vts: Select an approved vacation request\nto cancel
note right of emp: Request status: APPROVED\n(in future or recent past - within 5 business days)

vts -> db: Retrieve full request details
db -> vts: Return request data\n(dates, status, approval info)
vts -> vts: Check request timing\n(future or recent past?)

alt Request is in the future
  vts -> emp: Prompt for cancellation confirmation
  emp -> emp: Review request details
  emp -> vts: Confirm cancellation action
  note right of emp: No explanation required
  
else Request is in recent past (within 5 business days)
  vts -> emp: Prompt for cancellation confirmation\nand request explanation
  emp -> emp: Review request details
  emp -> vts: Provide cancellation explanation\nand confirm cancellation action
  note right of emp: Explanation required for past requests
end

vts -> vts: Validate cancellation conditions\n(request is approved and within timeframe)

alt Cancellation Validation Failed
  vts -> vts: Identify validation error\n(e.g., request too far in past)
  vts -> emp: Display error message
  note right of vts: Cancellation not allowed
  
else Cancellation Validation Successful
  vts -> db: Update request status to CANCELED\n(status: CANCELED)
  db -> db: Store updated request
  db -> vts: Confirm status update
  
  vts -> db: Return deducted vacation hours\nto employee balance
  db -> db: Restore vacation time allowance
  db -> vts: Confirm balance restoration
  
  vts -> email: Send cancellation notification to manager
  email -> mgr: Email notification:\nApproved request has been canceled\nby employee
  note right of mgr: Manager notified of cancellation
  
  vts -> db: Update employee vacation summaries
  db -> vts: Confirm summary update
  
  vts -> emp: Return to VTS home page
  emp -> emp: Cancellation successful
  emp -> vts: Review updated summaries\n(balances and request status)
end

@enduml
